Package: SVDFunctions
Type: Package
Title: Set of Functions for Selecting Matching Genetic Controls without Sharing Genotypes
Version: 1.22
Authors@R: c(person("Alexander", "Loboda", email="aloboda@broadinstitute.org", role=c("aut","cre")),
